{"type":"text","timestamp":1790400919793,"sessionID":"ses_f23cca9b5ffe4KV6RPJ0lkx6yJ","part":{"id":"prt_0dc35f8db001KafgEedBKqhjzs","messageID":"msg_0dc35bce4001EvXLRrlhNSLYFW","sessionID":"ses_f23cca9b5ffe4KV6RPJ0lkx6yJ","type":"text","text":"The existing main scene already distinguishes `blue_bots` and `red_bots`, with one nearby and one distant opponent. I’ll add the two reusable sensor scripts, configure a nonzero base radius in the battle-unit scene, and preserve the existing per-instance stat duplication before passing stats to the detector.","time":{"start":1790400919771,"end":1790400919774},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_05bcfd03529057a9016ab75996fce08190a3aff424ddd97007","phase":"commentary"}}}}
